          <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
            What is &ldquo;Performative Complicity&rdquo;?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-stone-300 leading-relaxed mb-5">
            Neither straightforward <em class="text-white">false consciousness</em> (being duped by advertising) nor purely <em class="text-white">free consumer choice</em>.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Performative complicity names the structural condition in which consumers <strong class="text-white font-semibold">critically recognise</strong> the constructed, unequal nature of gendered marketing yet <strong class="text-white font-semibold">continue to reproduce</strong> feminised consumption practices because exiting carries real social, relational, and personal costs.
          </p>

