          <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed">
            Divided into two groups of five urban Romanian women (ages 24–45) to capture both adult identity work and intergenerational child-rearing dynamics.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-stone-200">
